      },
      {
        "heading": "How has Eastern Air Express’s federal business trended over recent fiscal years?",
        "body": "Eastern Air Express’s obligations increased from $0 in FY21 to $3.3K in FY22, $2.9M in FY23, $2.2M in FY24, and $5.6M in FY25. Eastern Air Express recorded $224M in FY26 to date, an increase of up 3870.1% year over year. The FY2026 total is fiscal year to date and therefore partial."
      }
